{"metadata":{"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"推出积"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"推出积"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在范畴中, 态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 与 $g\\colon Z\\to W$ 的<strong>推出积</strong> $f \\operatorname{\\square} g$ 为\n$$\r\nf \\operatorname{\\square} g \\colon (X\\times W)\\sqcup_{X\\times Z}(Y\\times Z) \\to Y\\times W.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"俯意象","text":"俯意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ 中的推出积记为 $\\square_X$.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"带基点对象","text":"带基点"}},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $X,Y$, 两个映射\n$*\\to X$\n与\n$*\\to Y$\n的推出积是\n$$\r\nX \\lor Y \\to X \\times Y.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>联合</h3>\n<p>对于两个对象 $X,Y$, 两个态射 $X\\to 1$ 与 $Y\\to 1$ 的推出积给出 $X,Y$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"联合","text":"联合"}},{"Plain":" $X * Y\\to 1$.</p>\n"}]}}